  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNCDF was established in 1966. The fund aims at contributing to financial services in the least developed countries through innovative use of technology and good regulations of markets and actors, i.e. financial inclusion. The fund contributes to increase access to credit to local development of both public and private sector in countries wit weak financial infrastructure and bank sector.</narrative>
  </description>
